<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
<title>Sami Portfolio</title>

<style>

body{
margin:0;
font-family:Arial;
background:black;
color:white;
overflow-x:hidden;
}

.header{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#000000,#111827,#1e3a8a);
}

h1{
font-size:50px;
color:cyan;
text-shadow:0 0 20px cyan;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

h2{
color:#cbd5e1;
font-weight:normal;
}

.btn{
margin-top:30px;
padding:15px 30px;
background:cyan;
color:black;
text-decoration:none;
font-weight:bold;
border-radius:12px;
transition:0.3s;
}

.btn:hover{
transform:scale(1.1);
}

.section{
padding:50px 20px;
text-align:center;
}

.card{
background:#111827;
padding:25px;
margin:20px auto;
max-width:400px;
border-radius:20px;
box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(0,255,255,0.3);
}

.card h3{
color:cyan;
}

.footer{
padding:20px;
text-align:center;
background:#020617;
color:#94a3b8;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="header">

<h1>Sami Shariful Islam</h1>

<h2>Student | Gamer | Sniper Player</h2>

<a href="#about" class="btn">Explore</a>

</div>

<div class="section" id="about">

<div class="card">
<h3>About Me</h3>

<p>
I am Sami Shariful Islam from Bangladesh.
Currently studying in South Korea at Kyungdong University.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Gaming</h3>

<p>
Free Fire Player <br>
Role: Sniper <br>
Team: Wizard
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Skills</h3>

<p>
HTML <br>
Gaming Strategy <br>
Leadership
</p>
</div>

</div>

<div class="footer">
Welcome To My Profile
</div>

</body>

</html>
